      "bytes": 13288
    },
    {
      "key": "u26_1",
      "text": "It depends on the kind of work you do.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "9ff8ebd38686d8a113d49e0b5adc684c5da95ac9b4fb1da175fbcb74a4388c18",
      "bytes": 11460
    },
    {
      "key": "u26_2",
      "text": "For example, I spend less time commuting.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "84d5deb1c2cccfe6f64dff1467ef4b1bb5359c1071073b26a6f2b8fb16b8ec7c",
      "bytes": 14202
    },
    {
      "key": "u27_0",
      "text": "You could try taking a short break.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "d518868809770c41b09366f6bce98a87a5c3190dede9b73e67e376d609e3e5bb",
      "bytes": 10284
    },
    {
      "key": "u27_1",
      "text": "Why don't we ask someone for advice?",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "a15d6985359a13ac6f0d453652698bcc0b62647bca0f6c3d1cd7bfc1965b2af7",
      "bytes": 12766
    },
    {
      "key": "u27_2",
      "text": "What would you suggest?",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "7877920a2c1d95b0743b95da4d69edbf14c5522176f48eaa4fcb95fa9e0c8ede",
      "bytes": 6888
    },
    {
      "key": "u28_0",
      "text": "That's not quite what I meant.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "11a7227674f7d7e724c756083f29a1cada9c175e9c1731866766b9631d2048c8",
      "bytes": 9109
    },
    {
      "key": "u28_1",
      "text": "Let me explain it another way.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "1e2e0c1c38bc579604cfd1c0e75f2efbffe55d7980d3bbf36f48eecf6afa51b2",
      "bytes": 9500
    },
    {
      "key": "u28_2",
      "text": "Do you mean we should wait until tomorrow?",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "0269c9350f297046e80c3969c047caf165b787e3ffcd22492e5c1cff0a8bba46",
      "bytes": 11460
    },
    {
      "key": "u29_0",
      "text": "I've finished the first part of the project.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "4f1e1077db6315f8eaff3ecab25e237d9d657f99f7b48a1c18f5621f6d92c813",
      "bytes": 14202
    },
    {
      "key": "u29_1",
      "text": "I'm still waiting for some information.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "c2c37d3b815a4333ee803ed9a2865c877d0c2611441ca2533364c78113034f5f",
      "bytes": 10415
    },
    {
      "key": "u29_2",
      "text": "I'll send you an update by Friday.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "4f30251d955ec0f5f23ddb11b036438d5334f85bc61cc41a771f3b90a0e7493f",
      "bytes": 10806
    },
    {
      "key": "u30_0",
      "text": "How's your week been so far?",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "b18b97bf88be44b055e9a0dde187bf104a4d171c657b97ab71e0cf5c29cc1e89",
      "bytes": 8978
    },
    {
      "key": "u30_1",
      "text": "That sounds interesting. How did you get into it?",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "79f4481ebdadd75d86af414e55c154586ea8bd4a751d3611f7682a4d927c29f6",
      "bytes": 14855
    },
    {
      "key": "u30_2",
      "text": "I've always wanted to try that.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "b574529cdcebdc2d71502d52f112cc0afe37cd584edaef6dd9aa5baef540dfe1",
      "bytes": 11068
    },
    {
      "key": "u31_0",
      "text": "I don't know the word, but it's used for cooking.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "e77d85b1f0bfa66ffe25a2f9cccab8ceca9a51cc94b1f486bce6cc6f308103f7",
      "bytes": 14072
    },
    {
      "key": "u31_1",
      "text": "It's similar to a small oven.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "cb2e9ad3b5defbb1a16e2f8eb03f59a469d545d7faa9f7c982a50bababea9f60",
      "bytes": 8847
    },
    {
      "key": "u31_2",
      "text": "What do you call that in English?",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "54df5e9fbfbf594b1ee26f6c22ac77d87c35b24b2d850dc43a43086d5f3c1435",
      "bytes": 9762
    },
    {
      "key": "u32_0",
      "text": "Our plans have changed at the last minute.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "98bf4920a28dfe67a1354db7f541719f346fb948516d85b3f4034d6b6c7c440e",
      "bytes": 14202
    },
    {
      "key": "u32_1",
      "text": "Would it be possible to meet online instead?",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "40859bcafb860a877feb139a1c43718311b8ee8714a0568bb7c82b93a17b070d",
      "bytes": 12766
    },
    {
      "key": "u32_2",
      "text": "Let me know what works best for you.",
      "pack": "level3.zip",
      "sha256": "8d116bdd629fe0fd3bfea6b29a0dc8a6cfb2519a89a2156de8370714046270d7",
      "bytes": 10415
    },
    {
      "key": "u33_0",
      "text": "The cheaper option may cost more in the long run.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "ba9b9ab1a992faaae839bacc999343d73128a6c0c8f23c51e733a540c558d3c8",
      "bytes": 14464
    },
    {
      "key": "u33_1",
      "text": "We need to weigh the benefits against the risks.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "7b20dfa482bc6b2c01ced5109b8a9275527b46d7e4da0699841e52e592581df0",
      "bytes": 14986
    },
    {
      "key": "u33_2",
      "text": "What matters most is whether it meets our needs.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "e6a202f0d095088c99826c8231d5184c2809a87aafdb1c7d01f29bd2b2aa5c94",
      "bytes": 15117
    },
    {
      "key": "u34_0",
      "text": "I see your point, but I'm not entirely convinced.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "9d638a53c303642317ebd93a89f6baf397e30393e36f8f2696a84b86a04570b1",
      "bytes": 16815
    },
    {
      "key": "u34_1",
      "text": "My main concern is how this would work in practice.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "86141a9b82770a44096a54458065affc36ca5325f65af11a8fbfdf7e429b3b98",
      "bytes": 16423
    },
    {
      "key": "u34_2",
      "text": "Could we look at it from another perspective?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "f9f817f0cba783f02e946cf21f76c122d3ef05da2daf769a3d1aa541ef6d3745",
      "bytes": 11590
    },
    {
      "key": "u35_0",
      "text": "If we extend the deadline, we could improve the quality.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "23cb726f593d349183dab734bea3fc2462da6364cecb7ce4378baba690994b07",
      "bytes": 17468
    },
    {
      "key": "u35_1",
      "text": "Would you be willing to consider a compromise?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "69c558be5d17ca8252d0196fd74dc4a36c1d8dfcdee6035bb89cf41f37f1c840",
      "bytes": 12766
    },
    {
      "key": "u35_2",
      "text": "Let's agree on the next steps before we finish.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "e72a7a85a87bca7fdecf089e46e02ae71e1a1a6d8d917893714d44a5da5ce948",
      "bytes": 15770
    },
    {
      "key": "u36_0",
      "text": "The process consists of three main stages.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "0a415aebb811cc0006816cb35ff318f5ffd440fcc5b963df7e60b00efdb4f487",
      "bytes": 14594
    },
    {
      "key": "u36_1",
      "text": "Once you've completed this step, you can move on.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "9c87ae320da998e42333770e09c5ee8b472826394fa1e6394afdd5740bc141c5",
      "bytes": 14072
    },
    {
      "key": "u36_2",
      "text": "Would it help if I walked you through an example?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "a2a9d5e2a255401506b5704d45b790eba04cca3797b846fc87c414aa0d9caf5f",
      "bytes": 11590
    },
    {
      "key": "u37_0",
      "text": "I'm not sure how reliable that source is.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "a765573e73751f1c4fffdbb5bb5fd0dd91e80dc8b7f64b5c5413103eae51511d",
      "bytes": 13941
    },
    {
      "key": "u37_1",
      "text": "The evidence seems to support a different conclusion.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "2ba14745c7e68ba4d67db614e9bf625180b6372ba6d60e313fff2159a2d727d1",
      "bytes": 14986
    },
    {
      "key": "u37_2",
      "text": "We should distinguish between facts and opinions.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "1614495e523f7784bd6625dbce019ee60d776b28d4443bd351f18818d2003eec",
      "bytes": 14202
    },
    {
      "key": "u38_0",
      "text": "In my experience, expectations vary from place to place.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "1a020dd6e338ee4a10d2ab79068b79c70be646e70862fafd2011c24ae62bcfae",
      "bytes": 19035
    },
    {
      "key": "u38_1",
      "text": "I wouldn't want to make a generalization.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "e6e800f1244c4bf3ae4c39362cd95d44e73a44d2aa46b3b7c67e3e416d1c74c2",
      "bytes": 12635
    },
    {
      "key": "u38_2",
      "text": "How is that usually handled where you live?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "6d264b218cd7801a42341270a2c1b6ddcf075620e29bebf22e35d3114b2314ba",
      "bytes": 12635
    },
    {
      "key": "u39_0",
      "text": "I appreciated how clearly you explained the problem.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "50c24e4dac20d04b51142d1a8d27a37ccebfee0b3839590042a43d7c9c0a2ed5",
      "bytes": 16031
    },
    {
      "key": "u39_1",
      "text": "One thing we could improve is the handover process.",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "4d120b11cfc2a83d287b8163b670ca8f6502ac7c1ae0c15d648089e9c8d64d8e",
      "bytes": 17076
    },
    {
      "key": "u39_2",
      "text": "Could we set aside some time to discuss this?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "71531d82956354ce92fc80f0587dc896ec87807451d07b257a3c93d4ffa92e8b",
      "bytes": 13811
    },
    {
      "key": "u40_0",
      "text": "What led you to that conclusion?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "99afe6eac3b4a98217ab183af7ed0589d798729715f4cbca34bf1247bee3d3e6",
      "bytes": 10415
    },
    {
      "key": "u40_1",
      "text": "Could you give me a concrete example?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "e0a87ba1b3587dc1bc30d4bf1335167c702e7e078ae9fd8927b88d74e024079b",
      "bytes": 10415
    },
    {
      "key": "u40_2",
      "text": "How would your view change if the situation were different?",
      "pack": "level4.zip",
      "sha256": "ab05fc8455686d268dfc5dfafff8132e5da55b6af2968630ef5cf592e1f19de7",
      "bytes": 14725
    },
    {
      "key": "u41_0",
      "text": "Are you suggesting that we should reconsider?",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "6dde13e490d50c95d4452a7651facecb9cc1ea1218628d1314e6b971c150de99",
      "bytes": 12766
    },
    {
      "key": "u41_1",
      "text": "I get the impression that you have some reservations.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "49a9a6c52e741d52c02a8b9ca62d7828384152d739d3f1427c06380e78db7070",
      "bytes": 14986
    },
    {
      "key": "u41_2",
      "text": "Please correct me if I've misunderstood.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "ac183652da8a9154207479a239d96913836d219623422d58ed72c0e6390ffae5",
      "bytes": 12766
    },
    {
      "key": "u42_0",
      "text": "Sorry to jump in, but could I clarify one point?",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "84aeb91832c73e0ac09e27b029e71ec36225dfcbf194a4b73394b19ba7ecdb71",
      "bytes": 15639
    },
    {
      "key": "u42_1",
      "text": "Please go ahead. I'll come back to that later.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "51aeacc031e943c41ffaa78db7292d6f8721865549fcca217a99ee45f1e55337",
      "bytes": 13941
    },
    {
      "key": "u42_2",
      "text": "Returning to what we were discussing earlier...",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "6b52f1ff61f8e18f3bde87f18cf4607b8c3456c6b95f6e002f77e21644d8da1f",
      "bytes": 12113
    },
    {
      "key": "u43_0",
      "text": "As far as I can tell, the situation hasn't changed.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "8f572564935e4a60d5580759e53348dce00563e850021d93be5c55acd8018556",
      "bytes": 18513
    },
    {
      "key": "u43_1",
      "text": "That's plausible, though we don't have enough evidence yet.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "ab2ee460a650723fd1ba7b63a8e269f7e8bf49313b73e0a3502ee83f322c0beb",
      "bytes": 16031
    },
    {
      "key": "u43_2",
      "text": "I'd be hesitant to draw a firm conclusion at this stage.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "122d2eb13d0e007b9a70d1af4d7550b540987c20c4fe2b2c44253f7c3da4b73b",
      "bytes": 17468
    },
    {
      "key": "u44_0",
      "text": "What I hadn't realized was that we'd met before.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "29edff08b2ee488f7a9a2b06d6d9d1f0419c0658718819d2f5fcb5493122e76a",
      "bytes": 14986
    },
    {
      "key": "u44_1",
      "text": "Just when I thought it was over, something unexpected happened.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "b9d52f67c25e2dfbae356c303acdac43529e24371e8674dcd35cb409e40b394d",
      "bytes": 15509
    },
    {
      "key": "u44_2",
      "text": "Looking back, that's what made the experience worthwhile.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "96286b2d92001c709ca8a7350554b1aab74402a1938ce90b3980cfcfbdecc293",
      "bytes": 17468
    },
    {
      "key": "u45_0",
      "text": "Could you send me the details when you have a moment?",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "df54d9b16f7c784183db043768ca86890792ed42f72fb4c176326e5b330d9578",
      "bytes": 13549
    },
    {
      "key": "u45_1",
      "text": "I'd appreciate it if you could confirm receipt.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "3d85b8b2217bd2dd38b99376407fa3bd76a4346af4affd8f3fd3ba42f6c431a6",
      "bytes": 13027
    },
    {
      "key": "u45_2",
      "text": "Just checking whether you got my message.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "b717f6c7f15fc762b74e6df583d5c9fbdc2ddaf97d2dd71004f4b1812807cfe9",
      "bytes": 11721
    },
    {
      "key": "u46_0",
      "text": "I caught the first part, but missed the last detail.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "e13f2a97329d01e8d39f22b6cc49537e32bca8ebb17fab0a8ad56e5b8d1dc779",
      "bytes": 16031
    },
    {
      "key": "u46_1",
      "text": "Could you rephrase the bit about the schedule?",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "65e3e2b501488b48d13adc15e547d28ffb097a7f4541b27feb299c864aed087b",
      "bytes": 13027
    },
    {
      "key": "u46_2",
      "text": "So, if I've understood correctly, we're meeting at noon.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "6bf72d26bee006901876670d3911191b10a0534d5cfe0c897b9224b8b4d4093c",
      "bytes": 19819
    },
    {
      "key": "u47_0",
      "text": "I can see why this matters to you.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "31c06802caf1e7e572538758bd277799ed2ede7e21b9c1b55b0401899e6e1d54",
      "bytes": 11068
    },
    {
      "key": "u47_1",
      "text": "We may disagree on the approach, but we share the same goal.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "d0054b3874ec9d719b62fa93c71cb954eb3bd1e4e30ae033b9a3abe5b211fbbc",
      "bytes": 22170
    },
    {
      "key": "u47_2",
      "text": "What would a fair outcome look like to you?",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "4e0d4fc059a382a0ac7de643495026cb2e339d6d167256a8699c47719ad30c43",
      "bytes": 10937
    },
    {
      "key": "u48_0",
      "text": "Let me make sure we're on the same page.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "218c284ca9fc8d267cac7cbcdead2870b6de081be1e19f8ffb36df38d27ac2e6",
      "bytes": 12766
    },
    {
      "key": "u48_1",
      "text": "Is there anything important that we haven't covered?",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "054023eb1ac1564ccc24fdd2d71e548e6bc059341e7379610d029d2d54ff2106",
      "bytes": 16553
    },
    {
      "key": "u48_2",
      "text": "It's been great talking with you. Let's stay in touch.",
      "pack": "level5.zip",
      "sha256": "e6127e8699c6e5f85b5bcbffd3458d6a6a804b444bddcad39b72a15eeaace685",
      "bytes": 16162
    }
  ]
}
